// Signing for the Mood Sync app.
//
// The default entitlements file is empty on purpose. A free personal Apple ID
// can install the app on your own iPhone. Personal teams cannot use App Groups
// or iCloud, and Xcode refuses to sign the app if those capabilities are on.
//
// The Home Screen and Lock Screen widgets still install. They show a setup
// note until the shared App Group is turned on.
//
// After you enroll in the Apple Developer Program, pick one line:
//
//   Live widgets:
//     CODE_SIGN_ENTITLEMENTS = MoodSync/MoodSyncAppGroup.entitlements
//
//   Live widgets and CloudKit:
//     CODE_SIGN_ENTITLEMENTS = MoodSync/MoodSyncPaid.entitlements
//
// Then point Config/Widget.xcconfig at the widget App Group file and build again.
// If the bundle id is already taken, change it here and keep the widget id
// in Config/Widget.xcconfig as this id plus ".widget".

CODE_SIGN_ENTITLEMENTS = MoodSync/MoodSync.entitlements
PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER = app.moodsync.ios
